[ceiling] Flat positive-Z closure above each front-loading magnet mouth and cured side keys. The 3 mm roof preserves the full supplier loading height below the retained pump-skirt support band at Z206.674. The empty mouth opens toward +Y for Tree (auto)/Default support removal before magnet installation. Geometry does not establish removal effort or roof finish.
alternatives: A ramp into the mouth obstructs the full-height loading envelope. A raised 45° roof across the 9.85 mm keyed span reaches above Z207.780, entering the retained skirt-support band and its aft stock. Opening the roof removes the cured fill’s Z closure. Retain the flat closure and its accessible loading mouth.
